  "availableCapitalTitle": "Available Lending Capital",
  "@availableCapitalTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about available capital"
  },
  "availableCapitalDescription": "\"Available Lending Capital\" works as a safety limit and financial planning tool for your lending business.\n\n**What is it for?**\nThis value sets a maximum ceiling for the total capital you can have lent out (on the street) at any given time. It is not a real bank account, but an administrative limit you define yourself.\n\n**What happens if I enable it?**\nWhen \"Validate Working Capital\" is enabled, before creating a new loan, the system will check if you have sufficient available balance.\n\n1. **Calculation:** The sum of all active lent capital is subtracted from this global limit.\n2. **Validation:** If the new loan exceeds the remaining amount, the system will warn you and prevent loan creation to avoid unplanned overdrafts.\n\n**Recommendation:**\nKeep this value updated according to your actual investment capacity or the budget you have assigned for your loan portfolio. If your business grows, remember to increase this limit.",
  "@availableCapitalDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the available capital feature"
  },
  "capitalizeInterestTitle": "Interest Capitalization",
  "@capitalizeInterestTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about interest capitalization"
  },
  "capitalizeInterestDescription": "This option allows converting unpaid interest into new principal.\n\n**What does it mean?**\nIf a customer fails to pay interest on time, it is added to the loan's principal balance, generating new interest on the accumulated amount (compound interest).\n\n**Usage:** Enable this if your business model charges interest on interest for prolonged delinquency.",
  "@capitalizeInterestDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the interest capitalization feature"
  },
  "dailyAccrualTitle": "Daily Accrual (Prorated)",
  "@dailyAccrualTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about daily accrual"
  },
  "dailyAccrualDescription": "Controls how interest is charged if the customer pays off the loan early.\n\n**Enabled:**\nInterest is charged only for the exact days elapsed in the current cycle.\n*Example:* Paying halfway through the month costs only half a month's interest.\n\n**Disabled:**\nThe full cycle's interest is charged regardless of the payment day.\n*Example:* One day into the month counts as the full month's interest.",
  "@dailyAccrualDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the daily accrual feature"
  },
  "allowMultipleLoansTitle": "Multiple Loans",
  "@allowMultipleLoansTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about allowing multiple loans"
  },
  "allowMultipleLoansDescription": "**Enabled:**\nAllows a single customer to have multiple active loans simultaneously.\n\n**Disabled:**\nA customer must pay off their current loan before applying for a new one.",
  "@allowMultipleLoansDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the multiple loans policy"
  },
  "validateDniTitle": "Unique ID Validation",
  "@validateDniTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about ID validation"
  },
  "validateDniDescription": "Prevents duplicate customers in your database.\nWhen registering a new customer, the system will check if the ID number (DNI/ID Card) already exists.",
  "@validateDniDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the unique ID validation feature"
  },
  "whatsappReceiptsTitle": "WhatsApp Receipts",
  "@whatsappReceiptsTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about WhatsApp receipts"
  },
  "whatsappReceiptsDescription": "Enables quick sending of payment and disbursement receipts via WhatsApp.\nThe system will generate the PDF and automatically open WhatsApp with the file ready to send.",
  "@whatsappReceiptsDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the WhatsApp receipts feature"
  },
  "capitalRestrictionTitle": "Capital Payment Restriction",
  "@capitalRestrictionTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about capital payment restriction"
  },
  "capitalRestrictionDescription": "Prevents customers from paying down principal if there are few days left until their cutoff date.\n\n**Goal:**\nEnsure full collection of cycle interest. If principal is paid too close to the payment date, the calculated interest would drop drastically, affecting your expected profit.\n\n**Configuration:**\nYou define how many days before the cutoff this block is activated (e.g., 10 days).",
  "@capitalRestrictionDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the capital restriction feature"
  },
  "toleranceDaysTitle": "Grace Period Days",
  "@toleranceDaysTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about grace periods"
  },
  "toleranceDaysDescription": "Additional days you grant after the payment date before considering the loan \"Overdue\".\n\n**Example (2 days grace period):**\nIf paid on day 1 or 2 after the deadline, it's considered on time. On day 3, it becomes Overdue.",
  "@toleranceDaysDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the grace period setting"
  },
  "paymentOrderTitle": "Payment Application Order",
  "@paymentOrderTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about payment application order"
  },
  "paymentOrderDescription": "Defines the priority with which received money is distributed.\n\n**Interest First (Recommended):**\n1. Pending late fees\n2. Current interest\n3. Principal payment\n\n**Principal First:**\n1. Deducts directly from principal\n2. Then covers interest\n*Note: This option reduces the balance faster but may affect interest recovery.*",
  "@paymentOrderDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the payment application order policy"
  },
  "reportSettingsTitle": "Report Configuration",
  "@reportSettingsTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about report configuration"
  },
  "reportSettingsDescription": "Customize the appearance of PDF receipts given to your customers.\n\n* **Signatures:** Adds lines for \"Delivered by\" and \"Received by\" signatures.\n* **Legends:** Adds legal text or footnotes (e.g., \"Thank you for your payment\", \"Subject to late fees\").",
  "@reportSettingsDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the report personalization settings"
  },
  "sequencesTitle": "Sequences",
  "@sequencesTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about sequences"
  },
  "sequencesDescription": "Allows manual adjustment of control numbers for Loans and Receipts.\n\n**Loans:**\nDefines the number of the *last* created loan (e.g., 100). The next loan will be 101.\nUseful if you are migrating data from another system and want to continue your numbering.\n\n**Receipts:**\nSame as loans, defines the last number generated for payment receipts.",
  "@sequencesDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the sequence management feature"
  },
  "maintenanceTitle": "Maintenance & Backups",
  "@maintenanceTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about maintenance"
  },
  "maintenanceDescription": "Critical tools to protect and manage your data.\n\n**Export Backup:** Creates a full copy of your database. Do this regularly!\n**Backup Folder:** Choose where backups are saved (useful for cloud syncing).\n**Restore:** Recover your data from a previous backup file.\n**Recalculate Portfolio:** Fixes balance inconsistencies if you notice calculation errors.\n**Delete Data:** *Danger Zone*. Permanently removes data to reset or clean up.",
  "@maintenanceDescription": {
    "description": "Detailed explanation of the maintenance tools"
  },
  "appearanceTitle": "Appearance",
  "@appearanceTitle": {
    "description": "Title for the detailed help dialog about appearance"
  },
  "appearanceDescription": "Customize how the application looks.\n\n**Light Mode:** Ideal for bright environments.\n**Dark Mode:** Reduces eye strain and saves battery.\n**System:** Automatically adapts to your phone's settings.",
